[78.746696, "o", "*** Update File: orders_service/__init__.py\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[78.746739, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[78.746779, "o", "@@\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[78.74693, "o", "-# Existing content (if any) – leave untouched unless it interferes.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[78.74697, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[78.747072, "o", "+\"\"\"Top‑level package for the orders service.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[78.747109, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[78.747145, "o", "+\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[78.747355, "o", "+The test suite expects ``orders_service.create_app`` to be importable. The original\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[78.74739, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[78.747608, "o", "+package did not re‑export the factory function defined in ``orders_service/app.py``.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[78.747706, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[78.748209, "o", "+We import it here and expose it via ``__all__`` so that ``from orders_service import\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[78.748272, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
