[78.748705, "o", "+create_app`` works without needing to know the internal module layout.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[78.748753, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[78.74879, "o", "+\"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[78.749004, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
